  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I am doing a big map with a lot of  teleports, always working good, but now, when I tp to places I always faced the front direction (blue axis) now I face the red axis! I don't know why, and when I tp to other places that blue axis is facing the front direction, works good.\n\nSo on certain TPs, the orientation is works good, facing blue axis to the front, and on another tps not, they face the red axis. I checked and I have my unity set on \"Center/Local\"\n\nThe only thing I did is to put static the object that don't move, and do occlusion culling, but I undo all that and some tp's still wrong, and others working fine. \n\nI don't know what to do about this, I think it's a bug.",
